      {
        "conditionKey": "a1BulletTrickShiningShell",
        "source": "Chasca",
        "description": "A1 Bullet Trick: while charging Multitarget Fire, for each distinct eligible elemental type among nearby party members, Chasca has a chance to convert the 3rd shell into a Shining Shadowhunt Shell of that type and gains a stack of Spirit of the Radiant Shadow, raising Shining Shadowhunt Shell DMG by 15%/35%/65% for 1/2/3 stacks (max 3). It buffs the Shining Shadowhunt Shell specifically, NOT Charged Attacks in general, so it is applied via the bespoke `shiningshell_dmg_` key carried only by the skill.shiningShellDmg* hits. The other charged-tagged hits (aimed/fullyAimed, the C2/C4 shots and the A4 Burning Shadowhunt Shot) are Charged Attacks for scaling purposes but are NOT Shining Shells, so they do not get it — until 2026-08-04 this was approximated with charged_dmg_ and over-buffed every one of them. Pick the state matching the team's elemental diversity.",
        "states": [
